  "rowInventory": [
    {"row": 1, "band": [302, 353], "kind": "h3", "text": "77.　薄透镜公式　透镜的放大率"},
    {"row": 2, "band": [397, 443], "kind": "p", "text": "我们导出与三个量（物体到透镜的距离 $d$，像到透镜的距"},
    {"row": 3, "band": [473, 516], "kind": "p", "text": "离 $f$ 及焦距 $F$）有关的公式："},
    {"row": 4, "band": [545, 586], "kind": "p", "text": "由于 $\\triangle ABF$ 和 $\\triangle DOF$ 相似（见图179），得出"},
    {"row": 5, "band": [619, 707], "kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{\\lvert OD\\rvert}{\\lvert AB\\rvert}=\\frac{\\lvert OF\\rvert}{\\lvert BF\\rvert}$"},
    {"row": 6, "band": [740, 780], "kind": "p", "text": "因为 $\\lvert OD\\rvert=\\lvert A_1B_1\\rvert$，则"},
    {"row": 7, "band": [813, 901], "kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{\\lvert A_1B_1\\rvert}{\\lvert AB\\rvert}=\\frac{\\lvert OF\\rvert}{\\lvert BF\\rvert}=\\frac{F}{d-F}$　（6.15）"},
    {"row": 8, "band": [933, 975], "kind": "p", "text": "此外，由于 $\\triangle COF$ 和 $\\triangle A_1B_1F$ 相似，得出："},
    {"row": 9, "band": [1007, 1096], "kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{\\lvert A_1B_1\\rvert}{\\lvert OC\\rvert}=\\frac{\\lvert B_1F\\rvert}{\\lvert OF\\rvert}$"},
    {"row": 10, "band": [1126, 1168], "kind": "p", "text": "考虑到 $\\lvert OC\\rvert=\\lvert AB\\rvert$，可以写出："},
    {"row": 11, "band": [1201, 1284], "kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{\\lvert A_1B_1\\rvert}{\\lvert AB\\rvert}=\\frac{f-F}{F}$　（6.16）"},
    {"row": 12, "band": [1320, 1366], "kind": "p", "text": "现在我们使等式（6.15）的右端和（6.16）的右端相等："},
    {"row": 13, "band": [1395, 1479], "kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{F}{d-F}=\\frac{f-F}{F}$"},
    {"row": 14, "band": [1514, 1554], "kind": "p", "text": "由此得"},
    {"row": 15, "band": [1591, 1630], "kind": "p", "text": "$F^2=fd-fF-Fd+F^2$"},
    {"row": 16, "band": [1656, 1702], "kind": "p", "text": "或者　$fF+Fd=fd$"},
    {"row": 17, "band": [1729, 1775], "kind": "p", "text": "用乘积 $Ffd$ 去除上式中的各项，得到："},
    {"row": 18, "band": [1811, 1897], "kind": "p", "text": "$\\frac{1}{d}+\\frac{1}{f}=\\frac{1}{F}$　（6.17）"},
    {"row": 19, "band": [1933, 2018], "kind": "p", "text": "或者　$\\frac{1}{d}+\\frac{1}{f}=D$　（6.18）"},
    {"row": 20, "band": [2049, 2076], "kind": "foot", "text": "· 194 ·"}
  ],
